Roc Mind Spark
==============

This project is a macOS overlay app derived from MindSpark, an open-source
mind-mapping editor by Prasad Patil and contributors:

    https://github.com/prasadpatil25/MindSpark

The canvas (`web/public/`), local Node server (`web/server.js`), optional
Cloudflare worker, templates, and most of the editing UI come from that
project. Roc Mind Spark adds a native macOS shell (Swift / AppKit / WKWebView)
so the map can be summoned over any Space with a global hotkey.

MindSpark is MIT-licensed. This repository keeps that license and the original
copyright. See LICENSE and `web/LICENSE`.
